# Deliberately unlocked: addonfactory-ucc-generator-action v3.0.0 has a
# poetry.lock-triggered path that pip-installs "poetry==" (unset env) and, on
# newer action versions, REWRITES requirements.txt/package/lib from the lock
# at build time — silently changing the packaged app. Version determinism for
# the test env comes from the pyproject pins instead.
poetry.lock
